  T("corner", "Corner coaching", "Describe the bend, fix the line", "🔄", [LONG("corner", "The corner and what happened", "downhill right-hander, I ran wide and grabbed the front brake mid-corner")],
    "Analyse: {corner}. Text on what went wrong and why, steps for the correct sequence for that bend (vision, position, speed, gear, lean, throttle), bullets of cues to say out loud on the approach, and a callout on what to do if you run wide again.", "text, steps, bullets, callout", "Coach me", "Looking through…"),
